{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Vengeance</b> — twice in the Masorah: נקם ברית (vengeance of covenant), נקם אחת משתי עיני (one vengeance from two eyes), in connection with Samson, as stated in Sotah — for the Philistines violated their oath, and this is נקם ברית, which is an oath, for because of the oath they violated he said: 'I will take one vengeance.'"], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:48.410903492Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}